            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#E8EEF7', opacity: 0.5, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>本演示共 18 页，中间一章是重点：跟着屏幕，从一句话走到弹窗。</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 18, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
